        {
          "id": 2408,
          "hub_id": 12175,
          "version": "1.2.0",
          "description": "**What's New:**\n\n- **Advanced Healing Item Configuration:** You can now customize all meds to:\n    - Stop **light bleeding** and/or **heavy bleeding**.\n    - Cure **fractures**.\n    - Restore **blacked body parts**.\n- **New Stimulant: Exodrine:**\n    - Significantly increases **maximum stamina**.\n    - Drastically improves **stamina regeneration**.\n    - Comes with **severe side effects**.\n\n**Important Changes:**\n\n- The config.json file has been **completely overhauled**. If you were using an older version, you will need to reconfigure.\n\n**Note:**\n\nThis is the **final update** for this mod as I am working on a larger project that will include these features and much more .",
